    "content": "<div class=\"ncp-feed-preview\" data-ncp-feed-preview aria-label=\"로드러쉬 쿠폰 미리보기\"><div class=\"ncp-feed-stat\"><span>최근 보고</span><strong>3개</strong></div><div class=\"ncp-feed-stat\"><span>만료 기록</span><strong>4개</strong></div><div class=\"ncp-feed-stat\"><span>추가 후보</span><strong>5개</strong></div></div>\n<!--more-->\n<article data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\" class=\"ncp-coupon-article\"><style>.ncp-feed-preview{display:none!important}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"]{font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#253043;max-width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] *{box-sizing:border-box}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] h2{font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] h3{font-size:16px;margin:18px 0 8px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] .ncp-lordrush-featured img{display:block;width:112px;height:112px;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:contain}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] .ncp-lordrush-featured{margin:4px 0 14px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] .ncp-lordrush-lead{padding:12px 14px;border-left:3px solid #486e91;background:#eff4f9}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] .ncp-list-header,[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] .ncp-code-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:46px 116px 108px minmax(0,1fr) 74px;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] .ncp-list-header{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:9px 5px;background:#f0f4f8;border-bottom:2px solid #adbecd}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] .ncp-code-card{height:68px;min-height:68px;padding:5px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e5eb;font-size:12px}\n[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] .ncp-col-source,[data-ncp-article=\"lordrush-codes-202610\"] .ncp-col-expiry{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n[data-ncp-ar